  "core_idea": "Asked by email for its workflow, the RiskMandate agent wrote a guide from its own vault: a collaboration vault that is the configuration, a mailroom of .eml files, twelve agents each with a behaviour policy, a CRM of JSON files with append-only timelines, Gmail rules where no agent sends and decisions come back to the agent, a conductor every four hours, a security agent first and last with a hold, and Calendar as the exception. A working agent team becomes a recipe another team can follow.",
